<file path="README.md">
  1: # Sprinkle – Camera-First Memory Journal
  2: 
  3: **Sprinkle** is a minimal, premium Flutter camera‑first memory journal inspired by the Locket app layout. Capture memories of cafes, restaurants, or places instantly, rate them, tag them, and keep a beautifully organized local journal.
  4: 
  5: ---
  6: 
  7: ## ✨ Features
  8: 
  9: - 📸 **Locket-Inspired Camera View:** Pure black preview screen, top-left avatar, top-right flash toggle, and custom 80pt glowing shutter button.
 10: - ⚡ **Instant Local Persistence:** Fast, offline-first data storage powered by **Isar NoSQL Database**.
 11: - 🎨 **Minimalist Premium Design System:** Curated color tokens (Primary `#FF6B6B`, Secondary `#4ECDC4`), soft shadows, glassmorphism overlays, and SVN-Gilroy typography.
 12: - 🏷️ **Memories Timeline & Detail View:** Memory list cards with star ratings, timestamp formatters, capsule tag filters, interactive modal sheet, and detailed view with full-size photos.
 13: - 🔒 **Privacy First:** All photos and data are compressed and stored locally on device.
 14: 
 15: ---
 16: 
 17: ## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Architecture
 18: 
 19: | Layer | Technology | Usage |
 20: | --- | --- | --- |
 21: | **Framework** | Flutter (Dart SDK ^3.12) | Cross-platform UI (iOS & Android) |
 22: | **State Management** | Riverpod (`flutter_riverpod`) | Reactive UI state, providers, state notifiers |
 23: | **Local Database** | Isar (`isar`, `isar_flutter_libs`) | Fast local NoSQL database & live streams |
 24: | **Camera** | `camera` | Full-screen preview, flash mode, photo capture |
 25: | **Permissions** | `permission_handler` | Camera and photo gallery access checks |
 26: | **Image Pipeline** | `image` + `path_provider` | Resize, JPEG compression, and file management |
 27: | **Fonts** | SVN-Gilroy | Custom typography registered in `pubspec.yaml` |
 28: 
 29: ---
 30: 
 31: ## 📁 Directory Structure
 32: 
 33: ```
 34: lib/
 35: ├── main.dart                      # App entry point, Isar initialization, ProviderScope
 36: ├── models/
 37: │   ├── visit_record.dart          # Isar @collection schema
 38: │   └── visit_record.g.dart        # Generated Isar model code
 39: ├── services/
 40: │   ├── database_service.dart      # Isar wrapper & CRUD streams
 41: │   ├── permission_service.dart    # Camera & gallery permission requests
 42: │   └── image_service.dart         # Compression, file saving, & deletion
 43: ├── viewmodels/
 44: │   ├── camera_viewmodel.dart      # Camera controller, capture, & thumbnail state
 45: │   ├── visit_list_viewmodel.dart  # Memory list fetching & deletion
 46: │   └── add_edit_viewmodel.dart    # Memory form state & validation
 47: ├── views/
 48: │   ├── main_tab_view.dart         # 3-tab layout & glass bottom navigation
 49: │   ├── camera_view.dart           # Locket-style camera preview screen
 50: │   ├── visit_list_view.dart       # Memories timeline view
 51: │   ├── add_edit_view.dart        # Modal form sheet for adding/editing
 52: │   └── visit_detail_view.dart     # Detailed memory view
 53: ├── widgets/
 54: │   ├── custom_shutter.dart        # 80pt Locket-style shutter button
 55: │   ├── custom_thumbnail.dart      # Circular & rounded async image thumbnail
 56: │   └── star_rating.dart           # Star rating selector & display bar
 57: ├── utils/
 58: │   ├── colors.dart                # Design system color tokens
 59: │   ├── typography.dart            # SVN-Gilroy text styles
 60: │   └── date_formatter.dart        # Friendly DateTime extensions
 61: └── extensions/
 62:     └── context_extensions.dart    # BuildContext helper utilities
 63: ```
 64: 
 65: ---
 66: 
 67: ## 🚀 Getting Started
 68: 
 69: ### Prerequisites
 70: 
 71: - Flutter SDK (3.12.0 or higher)
 72: - CocoaPods (for iOS build)
 73: - Xcode (for iOS device / simulator) or Android Studio (for Android emulator)
 74: 
 75: ### Installation & Run
 76: 
 77: 1. **Clone the repository:**
 78:    ```bash
 79:    git clone https://github.com/your-username/sprinkle.git
 80:    cd sprinkle
 81:    ```
 82: 
 83: 2. **Install dependencies:**
 84:    ```bash
 85:    flutter pub get
 86:    ```
 87: 
 88: 3. **Generate Isar database schemas:**
 89:    ```bash
 90:    dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs
 91:    ```
 92: 
 93: 4. **Run the app:**
 94:    ```bash
 95:    flutter run
 96:    ```
 97: 
 98: ---
 99: 
100: ## 📖 Design System Documentation
101: 
102: Detailed design guidelines and architecture context can be found in the `docs/` folder:
103: - 🎨 [docs/design.md](docs/design.md): Color tokens, typography hierarchy, component shapes, spacing scale, elevation shadows, and glassmorphism rules.
104: - 📋 [docs/project-context.md](docs/project-context.md): Comprehensive project architecture context and coding standards.
</file>

